OL,3,AMore students planning to live at home
OL,4,Afor university over 'insane' living
OL,5,Acosts
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore new students are choosing to live
OL,8,Fat home for university this year than
OL,9,Fat any point in the last nine years,
OL,10,Fnew data shows.
OL,12,FOver 81,000 UK 18-year-olds said in
OL,13,Ftheir accepted university application
OL,14,Fthat they intended to live at home this
OL,15,Fyear, according to the Universities and
OL,16,FColleges Admissions Service (Ucas) -
OL,17,Fjust over one in three students in that
OL,18,Fcategory.
OL,20,FIn 2017, it was closer to one in five.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
