OL,3,AMore students planning to live at home
OL,4,Afor university over 'insane' living
OL,5,Acosts
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe figures vary across the UK - with
OL,8,F48% of applicants in Scotland intending
OL,9,Fto live at home, compared with 20% in
OL,10,FWales - but the trend is rising across
OL,11,Fthe board.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
